    "occupation": "Lieut-Colonel, Ceylon Rifles",
    "info": "Memorial stone in the church of Kandy, Sri Lanka. Served in the Peninsula and Walcheren in the 6th Foot; present at Roleia, Vimera and Corruna. Appointed to the Ceylon Regiment in 1810. After 35 years of Civil and Military duties in Ceylon, retired and died at Malta on 8 Mar 1846 aged 60"
